      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the \"else\" case, does a deferred call need to be set up later to run this function?\n\nIf I read the Intel power sequencing correctly, we\u0027ll be in S0 during HOOK_CHIPSET_RESUME for the S0ix-\u003eS0 transition, but not for the S3-\u003eS0 transition.  Does the USB3 state only need to be set for that particular transition?",
