      "writtenOn": "2022-08-17T03:24:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When plug Type-A card the USB3_Connection bit is enabled when booting into S0.\nSo clear USB3_Connection bit in S0ix,and need to set it back when S0ix-\u003eS0 transition state.\nIn this case the USB3 state only need to be set for S0ix-\u003eS0 transition.",
